<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1115 CDT - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins steady to 2.00 lower; butts not tested; sknd. hams steady; sdls. bellies generally steady; lean trimmings weak.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and offerings. -USDA</p>
